---
title: Quarterly Owner availability verification — implemented sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent
    participant W as Owner workflow
    participant U as Unit
    participant E as Event / Unit action
    participant S as Daily scheduler
    participant M as Sales Manager

    A->>W: Mark Listing Documents action Listed
    W->>U: listed_on and last_verified_on = today
    W->>U: next_verification_due = today + 3 months
    W->>E: Create one planned Availability Verification call + Event

    S->>U: On/after due date, lock Unit
    S->>U: Listed -> Verification Due
    S->>E: Reconcile exactly one open verification action/Event
    Note over S,E: Repeated scheduler runs do not create duplicates

    A->>W: Record Owner verification outcome
    alt Still Available
        W->>U: Listed, optional price update, renew plus 3 months
        W->>E: Create next verification action/Event
    else Temporarily Unavailable
        W->>U: Off Market, require a future verification date
        W->>E: Plan follow-up verification
    else Re-price
        W->>U: Pricing Requested
        W->>E: Plan Agent Pricing
    else Withdrawn / Sold Elsewhere
        W->>U: Withdrawn
    end

    S->>M: More than 7 days overdue: one manager-attention comment
    Note over U,S: More than 14 days overdue: excluded from new Buyer matches.\nScheduler never changes availability without an agent outcome.
